WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.067
Ukraine is gearing up

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.402
for a counter-offensive.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.370
The defense minister there

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.404
saying that preparations

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.772
are almost complete.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.840
And according to NATO,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.341
Ukraine's allies have delivered

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.311
98% of the combat vehicles they promised.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.812
Nick Paton Walsh is live in

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.581
Jaffa region in southern Ukraine now.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.449
So, Nick, preparation is nearly complete.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.852
What's the very latest there?

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.421
Yeah, interesting comments this morning

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.255
from Ukraine's

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.423
defense minister,

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.391
Alexander Isakov,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:24.858
saying that

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.760
preparations for the counteroffensive

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.028
are coming to an end.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.763
And he goes on to say, in a global sense,

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.465
we are ready in a high percentage mode.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.867
The next question is up

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.968
to the general staff.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.536
And as soon as it's God's will.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.837
The weather, it's been raining

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:38.905
pretty badly on off

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.273
air for the past two weeks.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.875
And the commanders decision,

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.742
we will do it.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:43.843
Now, this is from a government

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.378
to have over the past

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.713
two weeks been quite clear.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.281
They're not going to give us sort

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.417
of a starting bugle or an indication

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.018
as to when they decide to start

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:52.986
this counteroffensive

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.621
are made absolutely clear to

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.856
that secrecy is the high imperative

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.591
that's even been echoed by US

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.692
military officials

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.660
who say they've assisted

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.162
in training to make this, quote,

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.296
a surprise attack.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.565
So it is interesting to hear this sort of

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.436
detail discussion about readiness,

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.004
about whose decision it is, about

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.238
when that particular decision

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.473
may indeed come.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:14.607
And we sit on the frontline

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.241
ourselves, a

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.544
growing sense of anticipation

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.179
if not even movement,

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:19.979
suggesting

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.681
the counteroffensive is imminent,

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.649
if not possibly

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:25.585
seeing its opening stages.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.187
Spring is here.

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:29.556
After winter's frozen horror

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.223
and the buzz

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.758
and sting of Ukraine's

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.960
looming counter offensive is growing

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.401
aiming at Russian positions

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.802
within 30 seconds,

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.805
the Ukrainian unit has moved away

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.575
But it may be a precise operation,

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:52.846
but the Russian response is not

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.020
slamming

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.622
into the nearby town,

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.324
edging closer to us.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:05.425
Impossible to tell

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:07.193
what the Russians are trying to hit.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:08.261
But another example

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.063
of the intense bombardment.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:10.897
Their bid

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.565
to stop the counteroffensive

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:13.933
from starting.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.002
It is ordinary civilians

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:18.204
caught in the rising dust behind us.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:19.739
Who bear the brunt

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.474
of Russia's frustrated rage

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:26.279
along and around

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.780
the brutalized towns

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.848
where Ukraine says

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.817
it may launch its attack.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:31.951
There are more signs

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.621
it is underway lurking in the foliage

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.891
than Ukraine has given publicly.

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.058
That's because Ukraine

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.460
has said nothing at all

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.163
about when, where or how it will attack

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.834
But among machine gun fire in the nearby

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.003
trenches, a drone operators

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:52.038
hidden in the rubble,

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.740
the detailed, intimate picture

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.408
they have of their enemy

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:57.944
just two fields away is startling,

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.414
watching and trying to kill each other

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:03.249
every hour.

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:07.320
They've noticed the Russians pulling back

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.722
so many were still searching consumers

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.857
who came in from Syrian rebels.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.526
There's almost 2 million yourself

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.062
working as a typical school budget.

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.898
Over 13 killed short of the and yet

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:20.300
you know the U.S.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.901
Army shows of the professionalism

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.371
broadly the

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.174
drone and you don't know where Pushkin

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.742
will do headmaster now

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:30.777
and you still no you

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:33.213
I mean Australia will you the city was

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:36.149
another drone team has seen the Russians

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.116
also left

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:38.551
defending ruins

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:41.521
ridden by chaos in their ranks

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:42.155
just just

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:45.158
a disappointed Australia with some dudes

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.160
and as the supporters of the

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.695
of possible doom

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:50.830
to neurotic Macedonian strain

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.631
somewhat suspicious

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.266
you can have a little neurotic

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:53.900
streak goes on

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.168
as well as some of the puzzle

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.302
you will read.

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:59.339
It won't be long until that cunning

00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:02.041
or chaos meets a decisive test

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.245
in this flat, open and perilous space.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:09.682
The real issue of safe

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:10.416
Ukraine here

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:12.552
is the speed in which it can achieve

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:14.153
some strategic success here

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:15.188
because the Russians well,

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.789
you heard there of their ineptitude

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:17.824
and we've seen it

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.325
well over the last year

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.728
or so, have been able to bring mass

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:23.663
to this particular area,

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:25.431
the south separates area,

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:26.766
which many think is any target

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.167
for Ukraine's counteroffensive.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:29.702
They've dug trenches.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.871
They sent a lot of people to those areas.

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:33.506
And so some analysis thinks that

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:35.341
if Ukraine gets bogged down

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:36.576
in a war of attrition,

00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:38.845
along that long defensive line,

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.547
it could potentially find success

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:42.915
much harder to reach.

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:44.550
Its potential for victory

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.152
here is to move fast

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:48.955
and we've heard a lot of pinpoint strikes

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:50.323
over the past week

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:51.924
or so, particularly high

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:54.027
value Russian targets yesterday,

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:58.231
a lot of focus in a little poll as well.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:04:59.232
And that many,

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:00.633
I think, assess is a way of trying

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.669
to soften up Russia's defenses here.

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.871
Quite what else may be happening

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:06.973
as we hear this increased drumbeat

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:08.975
towards Ukraine beginning

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.743
this counteroffensive is unclear.

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:11.577
But as I say,

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:11.911
it's up

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.479
to Kiev really to show

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:15.748
to its Western partners here

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.517
who supplied training,

00:05:17.517 --> 00:05:19.285
weaponry financing

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:21.287
for a counter-offensive Kiev

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:22.955
and so much of NATO's

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.224
want to see to be decisive

00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:26.459
to be able to effect something

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:27.527
relatively quickly

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:28.594
and not get caught

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.163
in a long war of attrition

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:31.497
that ultimately may play

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:32.598
into the blundering

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:33.633
sort of massed

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:35.735
nature of Russia's force in that area.

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:37.036
It's a great point,

00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:39.138
Nick, and I would argue a long war

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.773
that many people don't want to see.

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:42.241
Nick Paton Walsh live for us there,

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:42.809
thank you.

